        "rating": 5,
        "text": {
          "text": "食物幾乎都很好吃，只有燒賣不太合我的口味。餃子和米飯套餐都很棒。服務生不太熱情，可能是因為語言障礙。",
          "languageCode": "zh-TW"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "The food was almost all good, only except for the siumai but that's only for my preference. The dumplings and rice meals were great. The staff are not really that friendly.  Probably due to the language barrier.",
          "languageCode": "en"
        },
